REGENT OF DOMPU

WEST NUSA TENGGARA PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF DOMPU REGENCY

NUMBER 02 YEAR 2024

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF DOMPU,

Considering : that women and children are very valuable assets to ensure the continued existence of the nation, therefore protection from all forms of violence and injustice is necessary;

. that protection is carried out to guarantee constitutional rights and the fulfillment of the rights of women and children to be free from violence and treatment that degrades the dignity of women and children; that to provide direction and foundation to all parties involved in the implementation of protection for women and children, a regulation is needed that can guarantee legal certainty effectively and efficiently;

. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Implementation of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia; Law Number 69 of 1958 concerning the Establishment of Level II Regions Within Level I Regions of Bali, West Nusa Tenggara and East Nusa Tenggara, (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1958 Number 122, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1655);

. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention On The Elimination Of All Form Of Discrimination Against Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);

. Law Number 20 of 1999 concerning Ratification of International Labour Organization Convention Number 138 Concerning Minimum Age for Admission to Employment (Convention on Minimum Age for

Permitted Employment) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 56, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3835);

. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);

